{"unit_id":"ctenni__dsh-hotkeys#card-zh","repo":"ctenni/dsh-hotkeys","commit":"c02a14a450c273072833966f16c1c557b80d32be","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Hotkeys 是面向 DSH Web 的浏览器端热键插件。它在页面捕获键盘事件，让你分别自定义消息发送、输入框换行和提问卡答案提交的组合键，并可通过 `/hotkeys` 选择预设或录制新键位。自定义发送键会触发 DSH 发送，换行键可在光标处插入换行；答案提交键作用于提问卡输入框。配置保存在浏览器 localStorage，无需额外 API 密钥或后端服务，适合希望调整网页端输入习惯的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:291-320","lib/client.js:386-423","lib/client.js:430-472"]}
{"unit_id":"ctenni__dsh-hotkeys#card-en","repo":"ctenni/dsh-hotkeys","commit":"c02a14a450c273072833966f16c1c557b80d32be","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Hotkeys customizes keyboard shortcuts in DSH Web. Use `/hotkeys` to choose presets or record bindings for sending messages, inserting newlines, and submitting answers in question cards. Settings stay in browser localStorage; no API key or backend is configured.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:291-320","lib/client.js:386-423","lib/client.js:430-472"]}
