{"unit_id":"ctenni__dsh-hotkeys#feature-1","repo":"ctenni/dsh-hotkeys","commit":"c02a14a450c273072833966f16c1c557b80d32be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Hotkeys 的功能「自定义发送键」：为消息输入框配置发送组合键。输入 `/hotkeys` 选择预设或录制按键；匹配时由 DSH 处理内置发送手势，其他键会合成 Enter 触发发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:291-320","lib/client.js:386-423"]}
{"unit_id":"ctenni__dsh-hotkeys#feature-2","repo":"ctenni/dsh-hotkeys","commit":"c02a14a450c273072833966f16c1c557b80d32be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Hotkeys 的功能「自定义换行键」：为消息输入框配置换行组合键。录制或选择绑定后，按下该键会在当前光标位置插入换行文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:291-320","lib/client.js:348-423"]}
{"unit_id":"ctenni__dsh-hotkeys#feature-3","repo":"ctenni/dsh-hotkeys","commit":"c02a14a450c273072833966f16c1c557b80d32be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Hotkeys 的功能「答案提交键」：为提问卡内的答案输入框设置提交组合键。可通过 `/hotkeys` 录制新键；插件在需要时转换为产品原生的 Enter 提交动作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:207-250","lib/client.js:386-423"]}
